(7562366, 1212340, 18367, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice portrait, Susan. Ray''s looking good here, but he''s not very good at hiding his cocaine habit. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not a cocaine habit my dear friend... that is something that is a remnant of a habit that I had when I was in the police force... that is powdered donut sugar.<br/> <br/>That''s my story and I am sticking to it.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Nice portrait, Susan. Ray''s looking good here, but he''s not very good at hiding his cocaine habit.   Not a cocaine habit my dear friend... that is something that is a remnant of a habit that I had when I was in the police force... that is powdered donut sugar. That''s my story and I am sticking to it. Ray', '2018-03-09 21:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
